description:
The purpose of this project is to&nbsp;assist with the salvage&nbsp;of windthrown&nbsp;trees&nbsp;across the Pomeroy Ranger District.&nbsp; ​Processing, decking and piling blown-down material&nbsp;is necessary to&nbsp;help reduce potential&nbsp;insect and disease infestations, reduce hazardous fuel loading, and&nbsp;retain&nbsp;economic value of the wood material.&nbsp; 

All questions are due   in writing  &nbsp;to   Kevin.Flores@usda.gov  ,&nbsp;no later than 10:00AM PST on 17 November 2026 

 Amendment 1 posted on 09 November 2026. See attachments for details
